Output backup-audit-pass.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 980
Set Height 420
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set Shell bash
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "source .venv/bin/activate && cd /tmp/backuplint-demo/pass && clear"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "backuplint scan compose.yml"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Sleep 2s
